{"code":"196700","name":"웹스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"화학","sector_desc":"석유화학·정밀화학·2차전지 소재 등. 유가, 중국 수요, 스프레드(제품가−원료가)가 실적을 좌우합니다.","desc":"동사는 2001년 고분자 소재의 개발, 생산 및 판매를 목적으로 부산에 설립되었으며, 2015년 코스닥시장에 상장하였음. 부산 센텀에 본사와 연구센터를 두고 청주와 양산에 생산 공장을 운영하며, 베트남에 해외생산법인을 설립하여 글로벌 첨단소재 기업으로 성장하였음. 동사의 첨단소재는 기능성 소재(골프공, 리튬이온분리막), 자동차내장 소재(인조가죽, 인테리어), 건축외장재(합성목재, 알루미늄 복합체)로 구성되어 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-30","n_days":300,"close":1369.0,"open":1324.0,"high":1394.0,"low":1240.0,"volume":151199,"amount":206991431.0,"ret_1d":5.2267,"gap":1.7679,"range_pct":11.2491,"ret_5":23.1115,"ret_20":5.7143,"ret_60":8.9968,"ret_120":-31.206,"ret_250":-0.9407,"ma20":1239.8,"ma60":1314.6,"ma120":1310.6167,"ma200":1685.0,"close_vs_ma200":-18.7537,"close_vs_ma60":4.1381,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-38.5894,"r2_60":0.3433,"slope_120":-21.2162,"r2_120":0.0501,"slope_250":-39.5728,"r2_250":0.2716,"high52":3490.0,"low52":945.0,"pos_52w":16.6601,"dd_52w":-60.7736,"mdd_1y":-67.5338,"atr14_pct":8.2646,"vol_ann_60":63.008,"vol_avg20":41423.65,"vol_ratio20":3.6501,"vr5":2.0404,"vr20":0.2871,"amount_avg5":142097081.2,"amount_avg20":52577927.35,"amount_avg60":79885632.1,"obv_chg20":53.8638,"turnover_20":5.7676,"pv_eff_20":0.9907,"rsi14":58.6616,"frgn_net_5":-6559.0,"inst_net_5":110488.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0457,"inst_net_5_pct":0.7692,"smart_net_5_pct":0.7235,"frgn_net_20":-28118.0,"inst_net_20":110488.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.1958,"inst_net_20_pct":0.7692,"smart_net_20_pct":0.5734,"frgn_net_60":-3690.0,"inst_net_60":220013.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0257,"inst_net_60_pct":1.5317,"smart_net_60_pct":1.506,"frgn_net_120":-238428.0,"inst_net_120":756333.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-1.6599,"inst_net_120_pct":5.2654,"smart_net_120_pct":3.6055,"foreign_ratio":2.59,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.26,"smart_buy_streak":4,"op_income_q":14.0,"op_margin_q":12.844,"op_qoq":75.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-12.5,"rev_yoy":-9.9174,"op_trend_4q":-16.1404,"fin_period":"202606","roe":12.14,"debt_ratio":75.09,"per":4.